{
  "_comment": [
    "Copy this file to settings.json and fill in your own UUIDs.",
    "settings.json is gitignored -- it holds identifiers specific to your",
    "Globus client and collection, and must never be committed.",
    "The client SECRET does not go here. It lives in the macOS Keychain:",
    "  security add-generic-password -a \"$USER\" -s globus_agent_client_secret -w",
    "New Claude Code sessions pick this file up automatically; a session that",
    "was already running when you created it will not."
  ],
  "env": {
    "GLOBUS_AGENT_CLIENT_ID": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
    "GLOBUS_AGENT_COLLECTION_ID": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
  }
}
